wlanpi-ctx (1.0.2-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Drop python3-distutils from Build-Depends and Pre-Depends. It was removed
    in Debian trixie (distutils is gone from Python 3.12+); python3-setuptools
    and the venv-bundled setuptools provide it. Unblocks the trixie build.

 -- Josh Schmelzle <josh@joshschmelzle.com>  Wed, 15 Jul 2026 03:36:42 -0400

